wsl-fido-bridge (formerly windows-fido-bridge)

This project, called windows-fido-bridge until version 0.2.0, is a Rust
reimplementation of windows-fido-bridge
(https://github.com/mgbowen/windows-fido-bridge, continued at
https://github.com/socram8888/windows-fido-bridge), originally written by
Matthew Bowen and contributors and licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
